    "created_at": "2015-11-24T14:13:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-24T14:13:25Z",
    "body": "Yes, but from that issue we also know that `only-if-cached` is not acceptable for security reasons and this would expose exactly that. And if we limit this to same-origin it would not at all be interesting for video content.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
